---
---

<section id="values-culture" class="section values-culture">
  <!-- kit: values-culture -->
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">How we work</span>
      <h2>Made to be handed down</h2>
      <p class="lead">Five ideas we hire for, argue about and come back to when a decision is hard.</p>
    </header>

    <ol class="vc-values" role="list">
      <li class="vc-value">
        <span class="vc-num" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Fix it, don't replace it</h3>
          <p>We design for repair first. A pan that can be re-seasoned beats one that can't be scratched.</p>
          <p class="vc-example"><span>In practice:</span> In 2025 we re-seasoned 3,100 customer pans for free instead of selling replacements.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="vc-value">
        <span class="vc-num" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Cook with it first</h3>
          <p>Nothing ships until the team has cooked with it for a month, outdoors and at home.</p>
          <p class="vc-example"><span>In practice:</span> The Cable Fold grate went through eleven prototypes and two camping trips.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="vc-value">
        <span class="vc-num" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Answer like a neighbour</h3>
          <p>Customer care replies within a day, in plain words, from someone who's used the pan.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="vc-value">
        <span class="vc-num" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Waste less than we did last year</h3>
          <p>Every year we cut scrap iron, packaging and shipping miles — and publish the numbers.</p>
          <p class="vc-example"><span>In practice:</span> Our 2025 scrap rate was 2.1%, down from 4.8%.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <div class="vc-photos">
      <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/caldera-foundry-pour/1200/1200" alt="Two workers in leather aprons pouring molten iron into sand moulds" width="2400" height="2400" loading="lazy" />
      <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/caldera-team-campfire/1200/1200" alt="The Caldera team around a campfire testing skillets at dusk" width="2400" height="2400" loading="lazy" />
      <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/caldera-care-desk/1200/1200" alt="A customer care rep on the phone at a desk stacked with skillets" width="2400" height="2400" loading="lazy" />
    </div>

    <div class="vc-perks">
      <h3>Perks</h3>
      <ul class="vc-perk-list" role="list">
        <li>
          <span class="vc-perk-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3c1.9 0 3.5 1 4.3 2.6A4 4 0 0 1 18 13.4V21H6v-7.6A4 4 0 0 1 7.7 5.6 4.9 4.9 0 0 1 12 3z"/><path d="M6 17h12"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span><strong>Gear allowance</strong><span>$600 a year on Caldera gear for you or your family</span></span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="vc-perk-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M16 3v4M8 3v4M3 11h18"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span><strong>Four-day weeks in summer</strong><span>June through August, foundry included</span></span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="vc-perk-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M19.5 12.6 12 20l-7.5-7.4A5 5 0 1 1 12 6a5 5 0 1 1 7.5 6.6z"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span><strong>Fully paid health cover</strong><span>For you and dependants</span></span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="vc-perk-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3.5 21 12 4l8.5 17"/><path d="M2 21h20"/><path d="M12 13 9 21M12 13l3 8"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span><strong>Two paid camping trips</strong><span>Product testing counts as work</span></span>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/careers" title="Careers">See open roles</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .vc-values {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 2.5rem 3rem;
    margin: 0 0 3.5rem;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .vc-value {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .vc-num {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--brand);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .vc-value h3 { margin-bottom: 0.375rem; }
  .vc-value p { color: var(--ink-2); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .vc-example {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--surface);
  }
  .vc-example span { font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); }
  .vc-photos {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }
  .vc-photos img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; object-fit: cover; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); }
  .vc-photos img:nth-child(2) { transform: translateY(1.5rem); }
  .vc-perks {
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--surface);
  }
  .vc-perk-list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin: 1rem 0 2rem;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .vc-perk-list li { display: grid; gap: 0.75rem; align-content: start; }
  .vc-perk-list li > span:last-child { display: grid; gap: 0.25rem; }
  .vc-perk-list li > span:last-child span { color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 0.9375rem; }
  .vc-perk-icon {
    display: inline-grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--brand);
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .vc-values { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .vc-perk-list { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .vc-photos { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .vc-photos img:nth-child(2) { transform: none; }
    .vc-photos img:nth-child(3) { grid-column: 1 / -1; aspect-ratio: 2 / 1; }
    .vc-perk-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .vc-value { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0.5rem; }
  }
</style>
